{"id":"derjenige","lemma":"derjenige","pos":"pron","rank":1395,"glosses":["he (who)","the one","this one, that one"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/ca/De-derjenige.ogg/De-derjenige.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Du bist derjenige, den ich mag.","en":"You're the one I like.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/757286","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to like","l":"mögen"}]},{"text":"Ich bin derjenige, der krank ist.","en":"I'm the one who's sick.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759415","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"the"},{"g":"ill, sick"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"}]},{"text":"Ich bin derjenige, den sie wollen.","en":"I'm the one they want.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to want"}]},{"text":"Ich bin derjenige mit dem Auto.","en":"I'm the one with the car.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"sein"},null,{"g":"with"},{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"car"}]},{"text":"Sie sind genau derjenige, den wir brauchen.","en":"You're just the person we need.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"just, exactly"},null,{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"to need"}]}]}